  "question": {
    "text": "If the coefficients of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>p</mi></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>q</mi></msup></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math> respectively, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>q</mi></math> is equal to",
