  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;The coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>p</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>q</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>p</mi></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>q</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;from the above expansion will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;which is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p>Similarly coefficient of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>On solving the above equations we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>15</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mn>11</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>63</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, the required answer is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>63</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>",
